              "fill": "$--color-text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Anna Lindström is a certified Stockholm guide with over a decade of experience bringing the city's rich history to life. With a Master's degree in Art History from Stockholm University, she combines academic rigor with passionate storytelling to create unforgettable walking tours.",
