                      "name": "bioP2",
                      "fill": "$--color-text",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "What drives Anders is not the delivery of facts alone — it is the moment when a guest suddenly sees a pattern, a connection, a new insight. That joy is his compass.",
