              "fill": "$--color-text-muted",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Anders' guiding grows out of a genuine intellectual search. He doesn't just share what he knows — he shares how he thinks. That gives his tours an authenticity and depth that is hard to find elsewhere.",
