                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Intellectual and engaging. Anders guides from genuine curiosity — sharing insights he has researched himself and presenting them as a conversation rather than a lecture. His focus lies on context and understanding, not on rattling off facts.",
