            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "4YaN6",
              "fill": "$--color-text",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "With over 15 years of experience guiding visitors through Stockholm's rich tapestry of history, Anna Lindström has become one of the city's most sought-after heritage tour guides. Her passion for storytelling transforms every cobblestone street and centuries-old building into a vivid chapter of Swedish history.",
