                  "name": "aboutBioM",
                  "fill": "$--color-text",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Born and raised in Stockholm, Anna has been sharing her passion for the city's rich history for over a decade. With a Master's in Art History, she brings academic depth and infectious enthusiasm to every tour.\n\nHer specialty lies in bringing medieval Gamla Stan to life. She has an extraordinary ability to weave together the stories of kings, merchants, and everyday Stockholmers into a compelling narrative.\n\nAnna believes that the best tours create genuine connections — between people, places, and the past.",
